  (text "Each sensor: VCC on the analog 3.3 V rail (+3.3VA, the same node as the RP2350 ADC supply), 100 nF right at the sensor (C1nn = sensor Un).\nOutputs KEY01-KEY30 go to the analog muxes (Muxes sheet). DRV5055A4 by default; the A3 uses the same footprint (bench test decides)."
    (at 20.32 158.75 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "694cf8f9-9539-583a-bb1a-736e5e9d5bea"))
  (text "Sheets connect through global labels and power symbols (no hierarchical pins).\nPower rails: +12V from the inter-bank connector, +5V (buck, LEDs + logic), +3V3 (digital LDO), +3.3VA (analog LDO: sensors, muxes, ADC), +1V1 (RP2350 core, from its own regulator)."
    (at 25.4 222.25 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "2adf0114-6e28-5b27-ab26-108d39d03fad"))
